  epo:specifiesProcurementCriterion <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/99cbe7d2-9e15-4abd-925d-16e39d3608f2-01/AwardCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_AwardingTerms1_AwardingCriterion1_SubordinateAwardingCriterion1>,
